# What the build context may NOT contain.
#
# Every service builds with `context: .`, so without this file the whole repo is
# tarred and sent to the daemon on every build - INCLUDING data/, which is ~43 GB
# once download-external-data.sh has run. None of it is reachable by a COPY: the
# only sources any Dockerfile names are src/train/, src/tts-service/,
# docker/requirements.txt and src/train/patches/*.py. These patterns are
# context-rooted (no leading **), so they carry the src/ prefix the restructure added.
#
# THIS BECAME LOAD-BEARING WITH THE HOST TRAINER. src/train/train-applesilicon/ has
# its own uv environment, and a macOS torch install is several GB. It keeps its
# .venv out of the context for exactly this reason - a .venv under src/train/ would
# be swept up by `COPY src/train/ ./src/train/` and baked into both trainer images - and
# keeping the whole directory out of the context as well means the mistake cannot
# be made by moving one directory.
#
# Only ADD entries that no Dockerfile COPYs. Excluding something a build needs
# fails at build time with a confusing "file not found", not here.

# Corpora, recordings and models. Gigabytes, and mounted at runtime rather than
# copied - see docker-compose.yml.
data/
output/

# Host uv environments. Not used in any image; src/record/ and src/preflight/
# never were. Context-rooted, hence the src/ prefix on the two trainer envs.
.venv/
venv/
.venv-*/
**/.venv/
src/train/train-applesilicon/
src/train/train-mww-applesilicon/

# The openWakeWord clone the HOST trainer patches. The images make their own clone
# at build time (see docker/Dockerfile.oww.cuda) and must not inherit a host one
# patched for a different device.
src/train/openwakeword/

# The microWakeWord clone the HOST trainer installs editable. The images make their
# own clone at build time (docker/Dockerfile.mww.cpu) and must not inherit a host
# one pinned to a different commit.
src/train/microwakeword/

# History and editor state.
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Python leftovers, which would otherwise invalidate layer caches for no reason.
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
# uv build artifacts from src/tts-service/tts_protocol (see .gitignore).
**/build/

# Host-only steps and prose. Kept out of the context so a doc edit does not
# re-send it; nothing in any image reads them. Context-rooted: src/ prefix for
# the restructured layout.
src/record/
src/preflight/
docs/
deploy/
*.md
training-*.log
